  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Brazil 2024 &#x2013; Scoping mission Porto Alegre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rio Grande do Sul, and specifically the city Porto Alegre, is facing serious water problems. The heavy rain and floods over the last weeks of 2023 and in 2024 have caused a humanitarian crisis in the city, leaving several neighbourhoods frequently without water and electricity. The topic has become a serious priority for the mayor and the city council.</narrative>
  </description>
